      },
      "body": "I'm still reading the PR and just got to the main Statics part. Mostly surface-level stuff so far, but I'm still somewhat confused why we validate the expansion type at invocation if it's a value expand is returning and it's a fixed type. It seems like expand being typed `Model -> Expand` could just be typed at livelit definition. I understand why this isn't the case in the papers quoted version.",
