      },
      "body": "No big concerns though I also agree with most of alexander's comments... A challenge here though is that you're building on top of user-livelits, which is mostly slop I haven't reviewed yet, so definitely don't take the existing internals as principled.\r\n\r\nI guess one thing I haven't fully thought out is how much we should be special-casing livelit def stuff as opposed to extending module features to support the required functionality. I'm fine doing the former for now but might be worth thinking about what we'd need from modules to avoid it.\r\n\r\nI'll do a functional review tomorrow",
